  "body": "\nBugfixes - 21.14.12\n===================\n\n- Upgrade embedded wheels:\n\n  - setuptools to `84.2.1` from `84.0.0`\n  - pip to `26.2.2` from `26.2.1` (#3452)\n\nImproved Documentation - 21.14.12\n=================================\n\n- Require a pull request news fragment and a matching changelog section before publishing. (#3445)\n\n\n[PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/virtualenv/21.14.12/)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.14.11...21.14.12\n"
